    narr:narration """This narrative hub centers on the [structured async decision platform](narr:Position_ProductCategoryAsyncPlatform) thesis, established in March 2026 as a direct counter-position to [real-time chat tools](narr:Position_AntiPatternRealtimeChat). The strategy targets [remote teams of 10-50](narr:Position_TargetMarketRemoteTeams) to mitigate decision-loss. While the initial [base pricing model](narr:Position_PricingTwelveDollars) was set at $12/user/month, internal retrospectives have already introduced tiered adjustments for larger teams. By August 2026, the focus shifted toward validating this thesis through [concrete sprint outcomes](narr:Position_SprintFourEvidenceOfThesis). Recent evidence highlights the [shipping of an async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_1) and a [record velocity of 23 points](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_2), with the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1787045470058_3) cited as a critical technical unlock for the platform's efficacy.""" ;
